    <string name="game_guide_body" formatted="false">Tap the planet to earn debris and buy upgrades to increase every tap.\n\nDrones collect space debris and generate passive income based on rarity. Rewards, clicks, and passive income scale with the selected planet.\n\nOpen cases to receive up to 12 drones. Higher-rarity drones collect better debris and produce more income.\n\nTemporary events change the rules and offer risks or rewards.\n\nPrestige unlocks at planet 10. Every planet has a unique bonus and an income multiplier.</string>
